            "frame_00000.png",
            "frame_00001.png",
            "frame_00002.png",
            "frame_00003.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Okay, as a form of continuation on the discussion on adverbs or expanding sentences through verb modification, we are going to proceed with the last structure of adverbs."
    },
    {
        "id": 1,
        "start": 13.68,
        "end": 23.36,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00004.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "So, last time we had adverbs that look like single word expressions, we also had phrase adverbs or adverbial phrases."
    },
    {
        "id": 2,
        "start": 23.36,
        "end": 28.88,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00005.png",
            "frame_00006.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "We now proceed to the last structure, which is the adverbial clause."
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "start": 28.88,
        "end": 37.76,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00007.png",
            "frame_00008.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Last time, it was asked what requirements are needed in order for a clause to be called a clause."
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "start": 37.76,
        "end": 44.48,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00009.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "A clause can only be called as one if first requirement, again, it's a group of words."
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "start": 44.48,
        "end": 50.24,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00010.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Second requirement, that group of words contains a subject and a predicate."
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "start": 50.24,
        "end": 58.72,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00011.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "The last requirement, that group of words with a subject and a predicate must convey an idea which could either be complete or incomplete."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "start": 58.72,
        "end": 63.52,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00012.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "If it's a complete idea found in the clause, we call the clause an independent clause."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "start": 63.52,
        "end": 69.2,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00013.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "If the clause delivers an incomplete thought, the clause is dependent."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "start": 69.2,
        "end": 74.0,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00014.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "When you talk of modifying clauses, what kind of clauses are they?"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "start": 74.0,
        "end": 75.52,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00015.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Dependent or independent?"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "start": 75.52,
        "end": 76.24,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00016.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Brain."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "start": 76.24,
        "end": 83.43,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00017.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "[Music]"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "start": 83.43,
        "end": 88.4,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00018.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "When you talk about modifying clauses, dependent or independent?"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "start": 88.4,
        "end": 89.68,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00019.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Dependent."
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "start": 89.68,
        "end": 90.48,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00020.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Correct."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "start": 90.48,
        "end": 96.72,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00021.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "All modifying clauses are dependent clauses."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "start": 96.72,
        "end": 98.4,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00022.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Take note of that."
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "start": 98.4,
        "end": 100.24,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00023.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "They are all dependent clauses."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "start": 100.24,
        "end": 108.96,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00024.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "And as a requirement, all dependent clauses begin with a subordinating conjunction."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "start": 108.96,
        "end": 111.36,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00025.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "That's a rule."
